Summary:

When a vault guard is wandering around outside the vault, and you kill
the guard, you are told that the vault corridor has collapsed.

Steps to Reproduce:

* Enter a vault.
* Wait for the guard to appear.
* Incite the guard to attack you.
* Teleport out of the vault.
* The corridor (if it exists) and the vault wall close.
* The guard teleports elsewhere on the level.
* When you find and kill the guard, you see the message "The
  corridor disappears" even though there is no corridor to disappear.

Expected Behavior:

The message will (possibly) appear when the vault wall closes, but not
when the vault is already closed and the guard dies outside the vault
or corridor.

